@startuml F4_Maintenance_Sequence
title Figure — Maintenance Sequence Diagram\nCreate → View (no QR) → Scan QR to process → Diagnose → Invoice (3 days) → Repair → History

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Tenant
actor Manager
actor Admin
participant "Front-end" as FE
participant "MaintenanceController" as C
participant "EquipmentController" as EC
participant "MaintenanceServiceImpl" as S
participant "EquipmentServiceImpl" as ES
participant "TenantPendingChargeService" as CS
database DB

== A. Tenant tạo phiếu ==

Tenant -> FE : (1) Submit maintenance\n(+ photos, appointment)
FE -> C : (2) POST /api/v1/maintenance
activate C
C -> S : (3) create(MaintenanceCreateRequest)
activate S
S -> DB : (4) INSERT MaintenanceRequest OPEN\n+ MaintenanceImage BEFORE
S --> C : (5) MaintenanceResponse
deactivate S
C --> FE : (6) Created + notify Manager
deactivate C

== B. Manager xem phiếu — không quét QR ==

Manager -> FE : (7) Mở ticket
FE -> C : (8) GET /api/v1/maintenance/{id}
activate C
C -> S : (9) getRequestById
S -> ES : (10) equipment snapshot
ES -> DB : (11) SELECT Equipment
note right
  maintenanceCount
  remainingDepreciation
  purchasedAt
  warrantyMonths
  remainingWarranty
end note
S --> C : (12) ticket + equipment
C --> FE : (13) qrScanRequiredToProcess=true
deactivate C

== C. Bắt đầu xử lý — bắt buộc quét QR ==

Manager -> FE : (14) Quét QR món đồ
FE -> C : (15) PUT .../{id}/confirm-arrival\n{ qrCode }
activate C
C -> S : (16) confirmArrival
S -> S : (17) assertQrMatchesEquipment
S -> DB : (18) UPDATE visitArrivalConfirmedAt
S --> C : (19) OK
deactivate C

== D. Chẩn đoán (không thêm ảnh lỗi) ==

Manager -> FE : (20) Diagnose\n(WEAR / TENANT_MISUSE)\n1 lần chi phí
FE -> C : (21) PUT .../{id}/diagnose
activate C
C -> S : (22) diagnose
note right of S
  Dùng ảnh tenant báo
  + xác nhận hiện trường.
  Không bắt buộc faultEvidenceImages.
end note

alt [Luồng A — hao mòn / công ty chịu]
  S -> DB : (23) UPDATE IN_REPAIR / REPAIR_SCHEDULED
else [Luồng B — lỗi tenant, khách trả]
  S -> CS : (24) issue invoice (due = +3 ngày)
  CS -> DB : (25) INSERT TenantInvoice MAINTENANCE
  S -> DB : (26) UPDATE TENANT_FAULT / REPAIR_SCHEDULED\n+ chargeInvoiceId
end
S --> C : (27) Response + issuedInvoice?
C --> FE : (28) OK
deactivate C

== E. Sửa chữa (không chờ thanh toán) ==

Manager -> FE : (29) Start repair
FE -> C : (30) PUT .../{id}/start-repair
C -> S : (31) startRepair\n(cần hoá đơn đã lập, không cần PAID)
S -> DB : (32) UPDATE IN_REPAIR / TENANT_FAULT

Tenant -> FE : (33) Thanh toán hoá đơn\n(trễ nhất 3 ngày)
FE -> C : (34) POST /tenant/me/invoices/{id}/payment

== F. Hoàn tất — ghi history thiết bị ==

Manager -> FE : (35) Complete + AFTER photos
FE -> C : (36) PUT .../{id}/complete
activate C
C -> S : (37) complete
S -> DB : (38) UPDATE CLOSED
S -> DB : (39) INSERT EquipmentMaintenanceHistory\n(+ photoUrls, repairCost)
S -> DB : (40) UPDATE Equipment.maintenanceCount
S --> C : (41) MaintenanceResponse
deactivate C

Admin -> FE : (42) Trang quản lý equipment
FE -> EC : (43) GET /api/v1/equipment/{id}\nGET .../maintenance-history
EC --> FE : (44) khấu hao, BH, history + ảnh

Tenant -> FE : (45) Mobile: thiết bị của tôi
FE -> EC : (46) GET /tenant/me/equipments\nGET .../{id}/maintenance-history
EC --> FE : (47) cùng bộ thông tin + ảnh

@enduml
